  "description": "The emotion of disgust is expressed through the text overlay, which humorously suggests that the wild boar is so 'disgusting' that it requires legal protection from hatred. This emotion is directed at the boar as a metaphor for humans perceived as 'disgusting' or 'unacceptable'. The visual of the muddy, dirty boar reinforces this disgust-based emotional response.",
